# UE5 Gameplay Prototype & Steamworks Integration

A research project developed in Unreal Engine 5 to explore C++ game architecture and external SDK integration.

## Key Features
- **Steamworks SDK Integration:** Implemented basic subsystem for Lobby management and Achievements.
- **Custom C++ AI:** Enemy logic utilizing Behavior Trees and custom C++ nodes (to fix Blueprint performance bottlenecks).
- **Debugging Showcase:** Resolved complex memory corruption issues during Hot Reloads.

## Tech Stack
- C++ 17
- Unreal Engine 5.x
- Steamworks SDK

